{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/479792-splitting-your-sekhem-and-apotheosis","id":479792,"title":"Splitting your Sekhem and Apotheosis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-13T20:06:25-07:00","id":479792,"title":"Splitting your Sekhem and Apotheosis","content":"One thing I haven't found is a discussion of the limitations of Apotheosis. For instance, can one sustain a Sadikh or a Talisman and attain Apotheosis? The latter would seem a fairly simplistic means of avoiding the limit of 1 Sekhem. For the Sadikh, it seems more likely that condemning an individual to such an existence is counter to the tenants of memory, as it essentially deprives your devoted servant of key aspects of their memory. Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2096-willywonka","name":"willywonka","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T20:23:17-07:00","id":479812,"title":"","content":"I see nothing against maintaining a Talisman.<br /> <br /> A Sadikh may be difficult due to the problems you have mentioned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T20:37:41-07:00","id":479841,"title":"","content":"Actually, if I remember the rules of a Talisman correctly, it says to treat your Sekhem as one higher for all purposes save the timing and number of dice rolled for descent checks. Apotheosis isn't a descent check, so it would mean treating your Sekhem as being too high to achieve Apotheosis so long as it is bound into a Talisman that you possess. Whether you can achieve Apotheosis after losing your Talisman, or whether you can benefit from a Talisman post-Apotheosis, is harder for me to work out. I'll need to reread the relevant passages a few times. My general inclination though is that attempting to get around the &quot;power is a shackle&quot; theme of Apotheosis via any other mechanic is working against the spirit of the rules, if not the letter.<br /> <br /> Certain elements of Sadikh don't mesh well with the themes of Apotheosis either. I'd be tempted to say the connection is severed by Apotheosis, allowing the companion to go to their proper rest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1059-azahul","name":"Azahul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T00:31:19-07:00","id":479991,"title":"","content":"...Honestly, I'd let the Talisman provide all relevant bonuses after Apotheosis and wouldn't count it against the requirements of Apotheosis.<br /> <br /> Sadikh however, would have to be abandoned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}